    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They came from far, far away\u2014for peace or just for fun. But their idea of fun is your worst nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aliens take you, and you wake up in <strong>Platform Park</strong>\u2014a strange place floating in space. The floor is <strong>lava</strong>, and you must solve puzzles and pass obstacles to escape. But you are not alone\u2026 Aliens are watching you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person puzzle adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, run, and solve puzzles to escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lava floors and tricky traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange alien world full of secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win the game or stay forever!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape Platform Park, or will you be stuck in the alien show forever?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They came from far, far away\u2014for peace or just for fun. But their idea of fun is your worst nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aliens take you, and you wake up in <strong>Platform Park</strong>\u2014a strange place floating in space. The floor is <strong>lava</strong>, and you must solve puzzles and pass obstacles to escape. But you are not alone\u2026 Aliens are watching you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person puzzle adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, run, and solve puzzles to escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lava floors and tricky traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange alien world full of secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win the game or stay forever!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape Platform Park, or will you be stuck in the alien show forever?</p>",
